# Walkthrough - General Backend API

This walkthrough documents the files created, the verification steps taken, and the results of running the multi-tenant image masking backend service locally.

---

## 1. Directory Structure

All files have been written inside the `backend` directory under the workspace:

* [package.json](file:///d:/IrisMono/backend/package.json) - Express, Drizzle ORM, node-postgres, and RabbitMQ dependencies.
* [tsconfig.json](file:///d:/IrisMono/backend/tsconfig.json) - TypeScript compiler setup.
* [docker-compose.yml](file:///d:/IrisMono/backend/docker-compose.yml) - Local RabbitMQ and PostgreSQL container definitions.
* [.env](file:///d:/IrisMono/backend/.env) - Local development credentials mapping to RabbitMQ port 5672 and the host-installed PostgreSQL port 5432.
* **Database & Migration Layer:**
  * [schema.ts](file:///d:/IrisMono/backend/src/db/schema.ts) - Drizzle mapping for organizations, users, invites, and jobs.
  * [index.ts](file:///d:/IrisMono/backend/src/db/index.ts) - Pool configurations.
  * [migrate.ts](file:///d:/IrisMono/backend/src/db/migrate.ts) - CLI migration execution.
* **Utility & Middleware:**
  * [domain.ts](file:///d:/IrisMono/backend/src/utils/domain.ts) - Wildcard wildcard-subdomain whitelist matching.
  * [auth.ts](file:///d:/IrisMono/backend/src/middleware/auth.ts) - JWT bearer extraction.
* **Communication & Queue Orchestration:**
  * [index.ts](file:///d:/IrisMono/backend/src/queue/index.ts) - amqplib assertions and queue publishers.
  * [index.ts](file:///d:/IrisMono/backend/src/sse/index.ts) - SSE subscription connection map and ping heartbeats.
* **Express Routers:**
  * [auth.ts](file:///d:/IrisMono/backend/src/routes/auth.ts) - Signup, invite-joining, and logins.
  * [jobs.ts](file:///d:/IrisMono/backend/src/routes/jobs.ts) - S3 URL presigning, atomic credit checks, queuing, and audit logs.
  * [invites.ts](file:///d:/IrisMono/backend/src/routes/invites.ts) - Allowed domains arrays, toggling, and revocations.
* **Entry Points:**
  * [index.ts](file:///d:/IrisMono/backend/src/index.ts) - API entry point.
  * [worker.ts](file:///d:/IrisMono/backend/src/worker.ts) - ML GPU worker simulator.
* **Verification Runner:**
  * [test-flow.ts](file:///d:/IrisMono/backend/src/test-flow.ts) - Complete end-to-end integration scenario execution.

